<!-- v1.19.0 — the OFFLINE LIBRARY icon (user request: a professional
     glyph that says "watch WITHOUT internet"): a bold download arrow
     landing on a tray, with a play-badge circle at the tray's right —
     "downloaded + play". White fill like every vu_ic_* pill icon so
     the pill tints it. Replaces the floppy (vu_ic_saved) on the
     browse top-bar pill and the hub's 4th card. -->
